  "source_pdf": "downloads/pigsys-boing-boing-band-v2.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "c4cfe081c0416e017820af9297cf18f0c12bbf2c1f55c6d125e879073b77e049",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5032f3a110b6b933b23c7107099ad526f616e2a7092516a64e652d91a27a77a0",
      "text": "Pigsy’s\nBoing-Boing Band",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b4e52dbe7524b520027ac23fb3b07a74a4121898544204de9e0ca50b3a0b4bfb",
      "text": "Pigsy makes a frog from a\nbig box.\nIt has a big, round belly.\n“Every frog needs a boing!”\nsays Pigsy.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "700274798ad47c6e83f63e5dd425bd612ea65e46568118dbbc415f61e9731a5c",
      "text": "Sandy helps.\nHe stretches two wide rubber\nbands across the frog’s mouth.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3883495718218f2c3fc5070b5cf5c70f0b99955a5bd5689d358a79f25839c81b",
      "text": "Wukong plucks one band.\nBoing! The frog hums.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "06281b35e84f70f154c23596f1887182ade1b4697bc2ef8d88ff3dfb16d902bf",
      "text": "He presses the band to\npluck again.\nThe sound stops!\n“Froggy, why did you stop?”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dc5f191391321ea99a6a7e26b2d48b91bbc200ad00b4c58fa56a34a2eb1ffebc",
      "text": "Pigsy pats the frog.\n“Are you sleepy, Froggy?”\nThe frog says nothing.\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b8a9220ff828022875693e3ebc22b73bc834da9aa8e4f7409b41a1b0e0d06508",
      "text": "Nezha has an idea.\n“Let’s watch and listen.\nPluck it again, and look at\nthe band.”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cab73452c50140b74d73d0e4e628c45d90cf38eb5a491ec43b57023a59afa327",
      "text": "Boing! The band shakes so\nfast, it looks blurry.\n“It vibrates,” says Nezha.\n“That makes the sound.”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d2448a21f7167bdecb07aa7ffc7b180cd8641d729be4f93e77b46a732d7c9ad1",
      "text": "Wukong presses the band.\nIt stops vibrating.\nThe sound stops too.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f0f2630a5b926c12026c418e70b2599c9ecefd2fb9f4371e0123760e4d3aee71",
      "text": "Pigsy plucks and touches\nthe box.\nBuzz! He can feel it shake.\n“It tickles!” says Pigsy.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2e8118c5a613111ebc62ddcf4368d560a8bdb1e535ef49c9fcef35fff4427480",
      "text": "Now they pluck both bands.\nBoing! Boing!\nWukong holds one band still.\nOnly one sound is left.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2b77ff569867341eb9b96522940c25109357890d656803efab6be7cfbbe60da5",
      "text": "“Shaking band, boing!”\nsays Wukong.\n“Still band, quiet!”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2bd1e8cdad72e787f7e04eca10f1b750a82d4b73f12825d5fb9a99758431f9b3",
      "text": "Pigsy wants a big,\nloud concert.\nHe reaches to pull the band\nway back.\n“Gentle plucks,” says Sandy.\n“The frog likes soft songs.”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "befe575bbf544ab49a907602c66f0a72c6883229832eec56897d886daf3eb225",
      "text": "Pigsy plucks one band.\nNezha plucks the other.\nWhen Wukong says “Stop!”,\nthey hold the bands still.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7756efaf3582f52de20b90cdb84afcbd848c057cdf5f74193de4b16d8612d479",
      "text": "Boing, boing… stop!\nBoing… stop!\nIt is a quiet little song.\nSandy claps softly.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6efe27454d800b8c8bb4020fedc45caeacd73b8b8284156ec917dcff272f4411",
      "text": "Pigsy bows to the frog.\nGrumble! goes his tummy.\n“A new sound!” says Wukong.\n“Snack time!” says Pigsy.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
